Fix the missed boss trigger, camera overhang and the Marble Mummy's visibility

Bosses triggered on a two-way distance test, so a player at full speed passed
through the radius and finished the level without meeting one. Found by a
30-second scripted playthrough, not the smoke suite -- an assertion-based check
that only drives the player a few steps never gets fast enough to hit it. Now
fires on entering the arena, and the suite covers the bounds case.

